{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Before Exit: Gas Station</strong>, you must close your workplace at night as a gas station employee. But wait, don't gas stations stay open at night? Not in this world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your boss is very strict and he loves to save money. When night comes, it means you have to turn off the lights, close the store, and go home. It's a gas station in the middle of nowhere, so why would anyone visit this place after dark?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/extras/f212aed9365f0143e22f28027e74124d.avif?t=1757668818\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Like its predecessor, the game combines roguelike features with logical riddles and a walking simulator genre to create a unique experience. Play day by day to find all the assignments, and finish every task before coming back home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the gas station is not just a different store our hero works at. Besides mopping the floors, cleaning the toilets, and restocking the most important items, you have a workshop to look at. Check if the tools are in their place and the car is properly closed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/extras/9f40d82eb24c363070a9b535bc756336.avif?t=1757668818\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's also the first time in the franchise you can actually walk out of your workplace before going back home! Check the fuel dispensers, and the oil stains, and get rid of the customers thinking they can fuel up at the last minute!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete every task to make your boss pleased. Do not make any mistake, as he is very observant and you are THIS close to getting fired. Anyway, have a lovely time at your charming workplace!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3268520?t=1757668818","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3268520?t=1757668818","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/e7782760e32be8a5ed63900e92fa2e38e2dc9369/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757668818","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/e7782760e32be8a5ed63900e92fa2e38e2dc9369/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757668818","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3714160,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Before Exit: Gas Station</strong>, you must close your workplace at night as a gas station employee. But wait, don't gas stations stay open at night? Not in this world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your boss is very strict and he loves to save money. When night comes, it means you have to turn off the lights, close the store, and go home. It's a gas station in the middle of nowhere, so why would anyone visit this place after dark?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/extras/f212aed9365f0143e22f28027e74124d.avif?t=1757668818\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Like its predecessor, the game combines roguelike features with logical riddles and a walking simulator genre to create a unique experience. Play day by day to find all the assignments, and finish every task before coming back home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the gas station is not just a different store our hero works at. Besides mopping the floors, cleaning the toilets, and restocking the most important items, you have a workshop to look at. Check if the tools are in their place and the car is properly closed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/extras/9f40d82eb24c363070a9b535bc756336.avif?t=1757668818\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's also the first time in the franchise you can actually walk out of your workplace before going back home! Check the fuel dispensers, and the oil stains, and get rid of the customers thinking they can fuel up at the last minute!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete every task to make your boss pleased. Do not make any mistake, as he is very observant and you are THIS close to getting fired. Anyway, have a lovely time at your charming workplace!</p>","developers":["Take IT Studio!"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268520/header.jpg?t=1757668818","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{